# Enforce LF line endings on checkout for every text source so that
# line-ending-sensitive tests (e.g. test/demo-workflows.test.mjs) and shell
# scripts behave identically on Windows, macOS, and Linux CI runners.
# Without this, GitHub's Windows runner (core.autocrlf=true) checks out text
# files with CRLF and breaks exact-match assertions against workflow YAML.
* text=auto eol=lf
